Input: Unlabeled dataset $\mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{train}} = \{x_i\}_{i=1}^n$ ; pre-trained LLM $\mathcal{P}$ and a downstream SLM $S$ ;  
1: round $\leftarrow 1$ 2: while not convergent do  
3: # For LLM: active annotation  
4: if round = 1 then  
5: # Initial self-generated demonstration  
6: Generate $\{(x^{\mathrm{gen}}, \tilde{y}^{\mathrm{gen}})\}$ as Eq.(2);  
7: $\mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{demo}} = \mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{gen}} = \{(x^{\mathrm{gen}}, \tilde{y}^{\mathrm{gen}})\}$ ;  
8: else  
9: Receive $\mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{demo}}$ from SLM;  
10: end if  
11: In-context learning as Eq.(1) for labeling;  
12: round $\leftarrow$ round + 1;  
13: # For SLM: knowledge distillation  
14: Robust self-training as Eq.(3)  
15: # Construction of $\mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{demo}}$ 16: Filter out class-wise clean subset $\mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{clean}}^j$ 17: Adopt k-medoids on $\mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{clean}}^j$ for $\mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{demo}}^j$ 18: $\mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{demo}} = \cup_{j \in Y} \mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{demo}}^j$ 19: $\mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{noisy}} = \mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{train}} \setminus (\cup_{j \in Y} \mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{clean}}^j)$ 20: Feed $\mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{demo}}$ and $\mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{noisy}}$ back to LLM  
21: round $\leftarrow$ round + 1;  
